/*******************************************************************************
 *  SMART BABY CRADLE - IoT MONITORING SYSTEM
 *  Board : NodeMCU ESP8266 (ESP-12E / ESP-12F)
 *          Arduino IDE -> Tools -> Board -> "NodeMCU 1.0 (ESP-12E Module)"
 *  Cloud : Blynk IoT (blynk.cloud)
 *
 *  Libraries (Arduino IDE -> Library Manager):
 *    1. Blynk                    by Volodymyr Shymanskyy  (v1.3.x)
 *    2. DHT sensor library       by Adafruit
 *    3. Adafruit Unified Sensor  by Adafruit
 *
 *  ---------------------------- WIRING ----------------------------------
 *  Sound sensor   : G -> GND,  VCC -> 3V3,  DO   -> D5
 *  DHT11          : G -> GND,  VCC -> 3V3,  DATA -> D2
 *  Moisture sensor: G -> GND,  VCC -> 3V3,  DO   -> D7   (diaper)
 *  Relay 1 (Swing motor / Fan-1, sound) : IN -> D1, VCC -> VIN(5V), GND -> GND
 *  Relay 2 (Cooling fan / Fan-2, temp)  : IN -> D6, VCC -> VIN(5V), GND -> GND
 *  Motor/fan: Battery(+) -> COM, NO -> motor(+), motor(-) -> Battery(-)
 *
 *  ------------------------ BLYNK DATASTREAMS ----------------------------
 *  V0  Temperature   (double)   V8  Fan_Button     (int, app -> device)
 *  V1  Humidity      (double)   V9  Mode           (int, 1=Auto 0=Manual)
 *  V2  Cry_Status    (int)      V10 System_Status  (string)
 *  V3  Diaper_Status (int)      V11 Humidity_Limit (double, app -> device)
 *  V4  Swing_Status  (int)      V12 Diaper_Text    (string)
 *  V5  Fan_Status    (int)      V13 Cry_Text       (string)
 *  V6  Temp_Alert    (int)      V14 Humidity_Alert (int)
 *  V7  Swing_Button  (int, app -> device)
 ******************************************************************************/

